<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has renewed a rarely used torture indictment against Maduro for ordering torture of rivals and has deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela while pressuring Reliance to refine Venezuelan oil. Opposition groups are staging nationwide protests demanding elections and the return of Machado, and a Dutch security report warns that Venezuela’s instability could threaten Curaçao and the wider Caribbean Kingdom. The Pentagon has issued a directive banning DoD personnel from using nonpublic information to bet on U.S. military operations, including those involving Venezuela. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxObzByT2NGVXJRM1dyM0o2Nm4zNVBualdTWkpKM2NuRm9VUXNQSVhTb3dMY2d0SnpJZFJqeU1sTlZCcTVLX3B0M1V5TjAtNDVGMGdaU0xRbU9zYUFZN2xQM2dFczBVSFNSR01qUkhHXzdpSC14RmdrdW5DajJrZFRJTWZia3puU29rRDV4dzB3a2V3YWJjbUlqWXlRY0Z5Q0hTb3hGZVVzbGRUb3VLZHM5dzdDZlc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOMFJUYjg5ajdBOXM3cFdVZlJQNFZNUHAtSUtIV0VFcWx1WVJsUzg0a0xsQTBuaWhFUHpYY0dHYzdzeXQ0NmtmVG9oMmstd0FGRWMwUXR5Y1RMUUUzTWFRdHVpY0FHM1pOSFZJYmVUX2c4dnBBZ2l5RjFnR1BpNkV3VVkwb1dzZWRRWVRSY3JtZUhuZXQyaS1jaVYzUVRSZjZRT2VVMkdqNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jacksonville Journal-Courier&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOb25yTEFUSFNha3lMNE1PVVBqaWtENkVuZ2VOeGFsTE1wV2pLdlhfQjlkQTd5aUF4Q0oxUksyY1RtYUFMcUVYTjVOejVaOFFiaDFwVHNMWUlINGlGNVE5S29OMEROWVoxTm81U3h0eXFwMVU4QWk0NkMwTmFvU2tCQzJqVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Newsmax&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPa0ZjY0NlblVSZ0JkaUZ6V1FZdTZyaXZQVkJpTUFDW